  "prefLabel": "Tra 601.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Tra 601.01 Purpose. The purpose of this part is to implement the statutory scheme set forth in RSA 236:69- RSA 236:88-a through regulation of the erection and maintenance of outdoor advertising devices.\n\nSource. #4507, eff 10-19-88; ss by #4835, eff 6-5-90; ss by #6237, eff 4-30-96; ss by #8005, eff 12-17-03; ss by #10033, eff 11-23-11, EXPIRED: 11-23-21\n\nNew. #14521, eff 2-27-26, EXPIRES 2-27-36",
